# SPEC-04 — Editing / NLE

Contract: `docs/spec-references/SPEC-04-editing-nle.md`. Inherits SPEC-00. Do not build from it until the user feeds this spec.

Desktop timeline mutations are the real edit spine. Web split must not zero trim in and out. JKL currently only starts and stops. Multicam and camera-RAW paths that are never called must not be advertised as working.
